<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69776" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>close-pressed, firm</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Gland.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμος</span>, i. e.
				<i>archer's reed, Arundo Plinii</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.85
			</span></i>; of a tumour, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφυγμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.931
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, Id.ib.<i><span class="en">
				509
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>solid</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				208
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.330
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				295.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναστός</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακοῦς</span>), ὁ,
				<i>well-kneaded cake</i>, esp. used in sacrifice,
				<i>cheese-cake</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				108.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				567
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1142
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Metag.
				6.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>filled full of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις ναστὴ ἀνδρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					6.9.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
